rface":"தண்ணென","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"taṇ","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"coolly"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தூற்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தூற்று","lemma":"tūṟṟu","gloss":"drizzle"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"-um","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"drizzling"},{"surface":"துவலை","parts":[{"text":"துவலை","lemma":"tuvalai","gloss":"water droplets"}],"gloss":"water droplets"},{"surface":"பனி","parts":[{"text":"பனி","lemma":"paṉi","gloss":"cold"}],"gloss":"cold"},{"surface":"கடும்","parts":[{"text":"கடும்","lemma":"kaṭu","gloss":"severe"}],"gloss":"severe"},{"surface":"திங்கள்","parts":[{"text":"திங்கள்","lemma":"tiṅkaḷ","gloss":"month"}],"gloss":"month"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புலம்","parts":[{"text":"புலம்","lemma":"pulam","gloss":"field"}],"gloss":"field"},{"surface":"பயிர்","parts":[{"text":"பயிர்","lemma":"payir","gloss":"crop"}],"gloss":"crop"},{"surface":"அருந்த","parts":[{"text":"அருந்து","lemma":"aruntu","gloss":"consume"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"-a","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to consume"},{"surface":"அண்ணல்","parts":[{"text":"அண்ணல்","lemma":"aṇṇal","gloss":"majestic"}],"gloss":"majestic"},{"surface":"ஏற்றொடு","parts":[{"text":"ஏற்றொடு","lemma":"ēṟṟoṭu","gloss":"with the bull"}],"gloss":"with the bull"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிலம்","parts":[{"text":"நிலம்","lemma":"nilam","gloss":"ground"}],"gloss":"ground"},{"surface":"தூங்கு","parts":[{"text":"தூங்கு","lemma":"tūṅku","gloss":"hang down"}],"gloss":"hanging down"},{"surface":"அணல","parts":[{"text":"அணல","lemma":"aṇala","gloss":"having dewlaps"}],"gloss":"having dewlaps"},{"surface":"வீங்கு","parts":[{"text":"வீங்கு","lemma":"vīṅku","gloss":"swollen"}],"gloss":"swollen"},{"surface":"முலை","parts":[{"text":"முலை","lemma":"mulai","gloss":"udder"}],"gloss":"udder"},{"surface":"செருத்தல்","parts":[{"text":"செருத்தல்","lemma":"ceruttal","gloss":"udder"}],"gloss":"udder"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பால்வார்பு","parts":[{"text":"பால்வார்பு","lemma":"பால்வார்பு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குழவி","parts":[{"text":"குழவி","lemma":"குழவி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யுள்ளி","parts":[{"text":"யுள்ளி","lemma":"யுள்ளி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நிரையிறந்","parts":[{"text":"நிரையிறந்","lemma":"நிரையிறந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தூர்வயிற்","parts":[{"text":"தூர்வயிற்","lemma":"தூர்வயிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெயரும்","parts":[{"text":"பெயரும்","lemma":"பெயரும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புன்கண்","parts":[{"text":"புன்கண்","lemma":"புன்கண்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"அரும்பெறல்","parts":[{"text":"அரும்பெறல்","lemma":"arumpeṟal","gloss":"rare/precious"}],"gloss":"rare/precious"},{"surface":"பொருள்","parts":[{"text":"பொருள்","lemma":"poruḷ","gloss":"wealth"}],"gloss":"wealth"},{"surface":"பிணி","parts":[{"text":"பிணி","lemma":"piṇi","gloss":"binding"}],"gloss":"binding"},{"surface":"போகி","parts":[{"text":"போகி","lemma":"pōki","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிரிந்து","parts":[{"text":"பிரிந்து","lemma":"pirintu","gloss":"having separated"}],"gloss":"having separated"},{"surface":"உறை","parts":[{"text":"உறை","lemma":"uṟai","gloss":"residing"}],"gloss":"residing"},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதலர்","lemma":"kātalar","gloss":"lover"}],"gloss":"lover"},{"surface":"வர","parts":[{"text":"வர","lemma":"vara","gloss":"to come"}],"gloss":"to come"},{"surface":"காண்போரே","parts":[{"text":"காண்போரே","lemma":"kāṇpōrē","gloss":"those who see"}],"gloss":"those who see"}]}],"literal":"Those who performed penance / certainly, my friend, in the cool / drizzling water droplets of the cold, severe month, / to consume the field crops, along with the majestic bull, / with dewlaps hanging to the ground, and udders swollen with milk, / thinking of their calves, leaving the herd, / returning towards the village in the distressed evening, / having gone bound by the attachment to rare wealth, / those who see their separated residing lovers return!","translation":"My friend, those women have surely performed great penance, who, in this cold and severe month of drizzling dew, are able to see their beloveds return from their quest for rare wealth—even as the majestic bulls and cows with dewlaps hanging to the ground and udders swollen with milk, thinking of their calves, leave the herd and return to the village in this sorrowful evening.","modern":"தோழி! நிலம் வரை தொங்கும் தாடையையும், பால் சுரந்து வீங்கிய மடியையும் உடைய பசுக்கள், தங்களின் கன்றுகளை நினைத்து, கூட்டத்தை விட்டு நீங்கி, கம்பீரமான எருதுடன் வயல் பயிர்களை மேய்ந்துவிட்டு, இந்தத் துன்பம் தரும் மாலைப் பொழுதில் ஊரை நோக்கித் திரும்புகின்றன. பனி தூவும் இக்கொடிய குளிர் மாதத்தில், அரிய பொருளைத் தேடிச் சென்று பிரிந்து வாழும் காதலர் திரும்பி வரக் காண்பவர், நிச்சயமாகத் தவம் செய்தவர்கள் ஆவர்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend during the cold season, which belongs to the mullai landscape. Her lover has gone away to earn wealth and has not yet returned, though the season of his promised return has arrived. As evening falls, she observes the cattle returning to the village: the cows, with udders heavy with milk and dewlaps hanging low, are eager to feed their calves, accompanied by the majestic bulls. This sight of reunion in the evening makes her own loneliness and separation even more painful. She laments that only those women who have performed great penance are fortunate enough to see their lovers return at this hour, while she is left to suffer alone.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}